00:26:33.000 --> 00:26:57.000
And it's not? What time would that have been, mate? So about 2,200 hours? It's not. 19th? Uncommon. Sorry, it's not unusual. Maybe once a week, or what night or so, one of us does sleep on the couch because we fall

56
